  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;LUIGI TOMMASO BELGRANO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Luigi Tommaso Belgrano is an Italian historian, librarian, and teacher who lived during the unification of Italy and contributed significantly to the preservation of the country's cultural heritage."&lt;SEP&gt;"Luigi Tommaso Belgrano is the full name of the person who feels a deep sense of belonging in Slovenia."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KINGDOM OF ITALY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Kingdom of Italy was a nation that rose to prominence in Southern Europe from 1861 to 1946, and it played a crucial role in the lives of individuals like Luigi Tommaso Belgrano."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENOA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Genoa is a key city in the unification process of Italy and was the birthplace of Luigi Tommaso Belgrano."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;VICTOR EMMANUEL II&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Victor Emmanuel II was proclaimed King of Italy in 1861, marking a significant event in the unification of Italy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BIBLIOTECA UNIVERSITARIA DI GENOVA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Biblioteca Universitaria di Genova is a prestigious library in Genoa that Belgrano directed and housed a vast collection of historical texts and manuscripts."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SLOVENIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Slovenia is a country where Luigi Tommaso Belgrano spent time as a historian and librarian, contributing to the understanding of its rich past."&lt;SEP&gt;"Slovenia is the location where Belgrano feels a deep sense of belonging."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LJUBLJANA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Ljubljana is the capital city of Slovenia where Belgrano spent time and conducted his research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATIONAL LIBRARY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The National Library is a place where Belgrano worked and conducted his research in Ljubljana."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EMPEROR FRANZ JOSEPH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Emperor Franz Joseph gifted the clock to Ljubljana, which holds significance in the city's history and is mentioned in Belgrano's thoughts."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ITALY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Italy is the country where Luigi Tommaso Belgrano lived and worked, playing a significant role in its unification and cultural heritage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIFICATION OF ITALY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Unification of Italy refers to the process by which the various city-states and kingdoms of the Italian peninsula were united into a single nation-state."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HISTORICAL JOURNALS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Historical Journals are publications where Belgrano shared his expertise and research on the history of Genoa and the Kingdom of Italy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ZLATOROG BEER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Zlatorog Beer is a local beverage that Belgrano enjoyed after his research in Ljubljana."&lt;SEP&gt;"Zlatorog beer is a local beverage that Belgrano plans to enjoy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CLOCK TOWER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Clock Tower is a landmark in Ljubljana that Belgrano noticed and thought about during his stroll along the river."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EMPEROR FRANZ JOSEPH I OF AUSTRIA-HUNGARY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Emperor Franz Joseph I of Austria-Hungary is mentioned as having gifted the clock to Ljubljana, symbolizing a connection between the two regions."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SLOVENIAN COUNTRYSIDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Slovenian Countryside is the setting where Belgrano spent time in Ljubljana, reflecting the natural beauty and tranquility of the region."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOCAL TAVERN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ESTABLISHMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Local Tavern is a place where Belgrano enjoyed a hearty meal and a pint of Zlatorog beer, symbolizing his social connections in Ljubljana."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENOA HISTORICAL TEXTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Genoa Historical Texts are the historical documents and manuscripts that Belgrano collected and researched in Genoa."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SLOVENIAN HISTORY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Slovenian History is the subject of Belgrano's research in Ljubljana, reflecting his interest in the region's past."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ITALIAN GOVERNMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Italian Government recognized Belgrano's contributions to the preservation of the country's cultural heritage."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TOME&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Tome is a term used to describe the dusty books and manuscripts that Belgrano studied in the National Library."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MANUSCRIPT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Manuscript is another term used to describe the historical documents and texts that Belgrano collected and researched."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ELDERLY SLOVENIANS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Elderly Slovenians are the sources of oral history that Belgrano listened to, gaining insights into the region's past."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;EMPEROR FRANZ JOSEPH GIFT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Emperor Franz Joseph Gift is the event where the clock was given to Ljubljana, symbolizing a historical connection."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CLOCK&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Clock is a significant object in Ljubljana, mentioned as a gift from Emperor Franz Joseph, symbolizing historical significance."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATIONAL LIBRARY OF LJUBLJANA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The National Library of Ljubljana is the institution where Belgrano conducted his research and collected historical documents."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENOA UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Genoa University is the institution where Belgrano pursued his career as a teacher and librarian."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ITALIAN CULTURAL HERITAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Italian Cultural Heritage is the focus of Belgrano's work, reflecting his dedication to preserving the country's rich history."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENOA RIVER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Genoa River is the body of water near where Belgrano taught and conducted his research in Genoa."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LJUBLJANA RIVER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Ljubljana River is the body of water near where Belgrano conducted his research and strolled in Ljubljana."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ITALIAN HISTORICAL JOURNALS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PUBLICATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Italian Historical Journals are the publications where Belgrano shared his research and expertise on the history of Genoa and the Kingdom of Italy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BELGRANO&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Belgrano is a person who is hungry and looking forward to a meal and a drink at a local establishment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BELGRANO'S STOMACH&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANISM"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Belgrano's stomach is mentioned for its hunger, indicating Belgrano's physical state."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;BELGRANO'S LOCAL ESTABLISHMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Belgrano's local establishment is a cozy place in Slovenia where he intends to eat and drink."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WOODEN SIGN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The wooden sign is part of the establishment and creaks in the gentle wind."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PATRONS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GROUP"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Patrons are the people inside the establishment who greet Belgrano with nods and warm smiles."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COZY ATMOSPHERE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ENVIRONMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The cozy atmosphere is the comfortable and welcoming ambiance inside the establishment."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOCAL ESTABLISHMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Local establishment refers to the cozy place where Belgrano intends to eat and drink."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WOODEN SIGN CREAKING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ACTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The wooden sign is creaking in the gentle wind, creating a sensory detail."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GENTLE WIND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"NATURAL PHENOMENON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Gentle wind is the breeze that causes the wooden sign to creak."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HEARTY MEAL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"MEAL"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Hearty meal is the type of food Belgrano anticipates eating."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PINT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"UNIT OF MEASUREMENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pint is the unit of measurement for the Zlatorog beer Belgrano plans to drink."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PEOPLE AND THE PLACE HE LOVED&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"People and the place he loved refer to the patrons and the establishment that make Belgrano feel a sense of belonging."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DEEP SENSE OF BELONGING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EMOTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Deep sense of belonging is the emotional state Belgrano experiences in Slovenia."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SOIL OF SLOVENIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Soil of Slovenia is a metaphorical reference to the land and culture of Slovenia."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0100</data>
    </node>
